```text
5

meet regulations that will assure maximum compatibility with the surrounding residential areas.
This property would be able to meet that intent within the context of a Community Business land
use in the area.

ZONING: FUTURE DEVELOPMENT - The ability of all potential future development to meet all applicable
standards for development in the proposed zoning district, including other development options in the
event that any specific development proposed in association with the application is not executed after
approval.

If for some reason the specific development proposed in association with the application is not
executed, other uses will be viable on this property and should be able to meet CB zoning
standards.

